# Source media kept out of the repo and out of the deploy.
# The SciPhyLabs reel arrived as a 173MB master. GitHub refuses any file over
# 100MB, and anything under public/ is copied into the build, so it lives here
# instead — untracked, on disk, and never shipped. The site plays the Short from
# YouTube, so nothing in this folder is needed at runtime.
media-masters/
